    "text": "Sprigatito & Lucario ex Starter Set ex, one of three Starter Sets ex released on 3 February 2023 for the start of the Scarlet & Violet series: a ready-built 60-card deck with one Pokémon ex, damage counters and markers, a coin, a playmat, a rule book, a game guide and a promo pack holding one of four cards meant to swap into the deck. Its deck holds Professor's Research with Professor Sada and Nemona in an Orange Academy uniform."
